# Aiven MySQL Project CA (pinned trust anchor) — see server/config/dbCa.js in the
# website repo for the security rationale. Fetched live 14 Oct 2026 by capturing
# the real TLS chain mysql2 sees; Test seam verifies: verifying against this CA
# connects, verifying against anything else fails the handshake.
#
# Valid 2026-10-04 → 2036-10-01. Aiven ROTATES this on service rebuild — if the
# DB connection starts failing with a TLS HANDSHAKE error after an Aiven
# maintenance, re-capture the new CA and update this file (or set DB_CA_PEM).
